 NoOrYesWithLongQuestion;myGuiParms;msg;parms
⍝ "No-or-Yes" dialog with  a quite long question
 myGuiParms←##.GUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults
 myGuiParms.regKey←'MyApp\Kai1'
 myGuiParms.icon←⎕NEW'Icon'(⊂'File'(GetFile'Sample.ico'))
 msg←'I have to make sure that you are really really certain about your decision, therefore please confirm:'
 ⎕←myGuiParms ##.GUI.Dialogs.NoOrYes msg
